*************************************************************************
* Supervisory file for TFR=1, one child at age 26 for all women
* Created on 25.08.2025
* Based on code by Liliana Calderon
************************************************************************
** NB: 
* Probabilities of death come from KINFERT
* Fertility rates come from Daniel Devolder
************************************************************************
segments  1
input_file presim

random_father 1
marriage_after_childbirth 0 
marriage_eval distribution
marriage_queues 1
* no heterogeneity
hetfert 1
* no birth interval
bint 12

************************************************************************
* Run for 300 years in order to have full kinship networks
duration 3600
include rates/fert
include rates/marriage
include rates/mort
run
